# Testing listChildren of a node with multiple children
# 0, 1, 2 heuristic (2)

# Create graph
Create Graph giraffe6

# Add nodes
AddNode giraffe6 node1
AddNode giraffe6 node2
AddNode giraffe6 node3

# Add edges, with node 3 being the parent
AddEdge giraffe6 node3 node1 edge1
AddEdge giraffe6 node3 node2 edge2

# Print children nodes
ListChildren giraffe6 node3
